          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Why Peanut Butter Is a Perfect Ingredient for Dog Treats</h2>"
          }
        },
        "text_Urc8Hy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you’ve ever given your dog a spoonful of peanut butter, you know how much they enjoy it. Peanut butter is not just a tasty treat, it’s a nutrient-packed snack that many pet owners incorporate into their dog’s diet. And now, with Snarky Pets’ Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats, you can offer your dog the same great taste and health benefits in a convenient, ready-to-serve form.<br/><br/>In this article, we’ll dive into why peanut butter is a great choice for dog treats, how it benefits your pet’s health, and why Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats are the perfect snack for your furry friend. You’ll discover the reasons these treats are a delicious, healthy option to add to your dog’s diet.<br/></p>"
          }
