        "heading_rXpewP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>How Peanut Butter Enhances Dog Treats</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>●Peanut butter isn’t just nutritious: </strong>it also improves the taste, texture, and nutritional profile of dog treats. Here’s how Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats elevate your dog’s snack time.<br/><br/><strong>●Delicious Flavor:</strong> Dogs love the rich, savory flavor of peanut butter. Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats from Snarky Pets are packed with that peanut butter goodness, making them the perfect treat for any occasion.<br/><br/><strong>●Crunchy Texture: </strong>The crunchy texture of these treats not only satisfies your dog’s chewing instincts but also helps clean their teeth. It adds a fun element to snack time that dogs absolutely enjoy.<br/><br/><strong>●Binding Agent:</strong> Peanut butter acts as an excellent binding agent in dog treats, holding together ingredients like oats, flour, and eggs. This ensures that your treats stay intact and are easy for your dog to enjoy.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
