          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>The Benefits of Peanut Butter for Senior Dogs</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_cE7LyU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>●Peanut butter can be especially beneficial for senior dogs, who may experience changes in metabolism, joints, and overall health. Here’s how peanut butter helps senior dogs:<br/><br/>●Joint Health: The omega-3 fatty acids in peanut butter help reduce inflammation, making them ideal for senior dogs who may suffer from joint pain or arthritis.<br/><br/>●Cognitive Function: The healthy fats in peanut butter support brain health and can help prevent cognitive dysfunction syndrome (CDS) in senior dogs.<br/><br/>For senior dogs, Snarky Pets’ Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats provide a tasty way to support joint and brain health while also satisfying their cravings.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
