        "text_Ff8GJk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Snarky Pets’ Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats are more than just a delicious snack—they are packed with essential nutrients that support your dog’s overall health. Made with natural peanut butter, these treats are rich in protein, healthy fats, and important vitamins and minerals.</p><p><br/>Remember to feed these treats in moderation and choose products that are free of harmful additives like xylitol. Your dog will love the taste, and you can feel good knowing you’re offering them a treat that’s both nutritious and beneficial.<br/></p>"
