            "text": "<p><strong>1.Is peanut butter safe for dogs to eat every day?</strong><br/>Peanut butter can be a great daily treat, but it should be given in moderation. It should make up no more than 10% of your dog’s daily caloric intake.<br/><strong><br/>2.Can I use peanut butter as the main ingredient in dog treats?</strong><br/>Yes! Crunchy Peanut Butter Dog Treats are made with peanut butter as the main ingredient, providing a tasty and healthy base for your dog’s treats.<br/><br/><strong>3.Can peanut butter help my dog’s joints?</strong><br/>Yes! The omega-3 fatty acids in peanut butter help support joint health and reduce inflammation, especially for senior dogs.<br/></p>"
